    "text": "By Hidden Valley Funeral Home Matt Griffith ,\n1 days ago David Silas Randolph, 74, of Carrollton, Missouri passed away at his home on September 22, 2026. Visitation will be held at 5:00 PM, on Monday, October 5, 2026 at First Baptist Church of Carrollton, 124 N. Folger Street, Carrollton, Missouri 64633. A memorial service will begin at 6:30 PM at the church. Read full article",
